      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "Jeff Bezos applied capital and engineering to the same industry with Blue Origin, starting in 2000, 2 years before Elon founded SpaceX. He was wealthier for most of that time, with better access to Wall Street. \n\nThe industry incumbents were around much longer than both, applying capital and engineering to the space industry. \n\nElon’s results with SpaceX are far above normal. He raised most of his capital from Silicon Valley, not Wall Street. \n\nCriticizing Elon is not the skill his haters think it is.",
      "quote": null,
